<title>OMAN: Oman issues decree for Phillips Petroleum deal.</title>
<headline>Oman issues decree for Phillips Petroleum deal.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman's Sultan Qaboos on Saturday issued a decree finalising an oil exploration/production-sharing agreement signed in June with Phillips Petroleum Co of the United States, the official Oman news agency said.</p>
<p>The agreement covers a 18,527 square km area in southwest Oman. The agency reported in June that the deal, signed in Muscat, stipulated that Phillips would spend $37 million &quot;as a minimum level within nine years to implement exploration work..and geological surveys.&quot;</p>
</text>
